    "body": "Since my recent update from homebrew `time starship prompt` gives me: \r\n\r\n```\r\nExecuted in  809.36 millis    fish           external\r\n   usr time  469.63 millis   83.00 micros  469.54 millis\r\n   sys time  383.79 millis  356.00 micros  383.44 millis\r\n```\r\n\r\nCurrent setup: \r\n\r\nFish\r\nFisher\r\nStarship\r\nAlacritty\r\n\r\nThis test was excuted in a monorepo containing a node project and a python project with a virtualenv. Prior to the update Starship was almost instant, now it's notably slow and annoying :( ",
