    "updated_at": "2021-01-25T18:49:06Z",
    "body": "This latest version has resolved the issue for me\r\n\r\n```\r\nstarship prompt  0.11s user 0.15s system 105% cpu 0.243 total\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nstarship timings\r\n\r\n Here are the timings of modules in your prompt (>=1ms or output):\r\n git_status  -  242ms  -   [$]\r\n golang      -   10ms  -   via  v1.15.4\r\n directory   -    3ms  -   consul\r\n username    -    2ms  -\r\n git_commit  -    1ms  -\r\n git_branch  -    1ms  -   on  je.ui-update-vercel\r\n character   -   <1ms  -   ❯\r\n line_break  -   <1ms  -   \\n\r\n```",
